3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> (floor -3, between entrance and <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> (west, east and south across river from <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tAn undead jester attacks from a distance. An undead jester will retreat at 107 to 212 (30.14% - 59.72%, yellow) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tAlways wear a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> to avoid getting drunk, as it will save you considerable time when trying to reach them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"semi-rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 337 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table cl